<#
============================================================================
  create-certificates-page.ps1
  Saachi AI (SAI2) - Web App
  Creates: apps/web/app/(learner)/dashboard/certificates/page.tsx

  Run from the SAI2 monorepo root, e.g.:
    PS D:\Rozmarrah-CUST\Saim Ashraf\Saachi AI\Working\Code\Saachi_ai_1\SAI2> .\create-certificates-page.ps1

  Notes:
  - Content is embedded as Base64 and written via WriteAllBytes to avoid
    the PowerShell here-string corruption issues (square brackets, curly
    braces, backticks) that hit previous scaffolding scripts.
  - All colors/spacing use the existing design tokens
    (apps/web/lib/design-system/tokens.ts -> var(--token-color-*)).
    Nothing is hardcoded here -- re-theme by editing tokens.ts only.
  - Uses Ant Design (Button, Typography, Tag) per the rest of the web app.
  - Adds "Certificates" to the local sidebar nav (Award icon, active state)
    matching the pattern already used in my-courses/page.tsx and
    dashboard/page.tsx. If you later extract a shared <LearnerSidebar />,
    you can delete this duplicated block.
============================================================================
#>

